{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "example", "parent_tag": "06ML", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$x \\in X$", "MATH_0003": "$x \\to X$", "MATH_0004": "$X$", "MATH_0005": "$x$", "MATH_0006": "$x$", "MATH_0007": "$x = \\Spec(\\kappa(x))$", "MATH_0008": "$X$", "MATH_0009": "$x \\in |X|$", "MATH_0010": "$x$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{decent-spaces-section-singleton}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{example}\n\\label{example-residual-gerbe}\n", "suffix": "\\end{example}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:efa956f4afebab5c6a386dc4ffe6f346ad16d049de6a56091e7ad035bb58f418", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6a799ee8d090d2e6a500f84a2d2f3e653638692afd1c1bee4b87e37656a5e669", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme and let <MATH_0002> be a point. Then the monomorphism\n<MATH_0003> is the residual gerbe of <MATH_0004> at <MATH_0005> where we, as usual, identify\n<MATH_0006> with the scheme <MATH_0007>. If <MATH_0008> is an algebraic space\nand <MATH_0009>, then the residual gerbe at <MATH_0010> (which is called\nthe residual space) always exists, see\nDecent Spaces, Section <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:67668cabf2f5cd71817c14551ab750c699ea340c8dd55d356914d0f7edaf85b5", "unit_id": "tag:0H21:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06ML", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bbb9aa0edc540579e0f2cebafb0b231e930f6d1d6eb1613cd370ffb70c048ea4", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe residual gerbe, if it exists, is a regular algebraic stack\nby the following lemma.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:57b5b437d24f3ef10b3d7efce3c5d74775b4c0cf0b536e2b8291080c889a67f5", "unit_id": "tag:06ML:prose-0006"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06ML", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0002": "$|\\mathcal{Z}|$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-residual-gerbe-regular}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:83848bcc912c7ceacf2086ac3629490931ab7e16bbc72fa2659a5a0bd6b8386a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d3819e164b809ab9989d5be281a773534bb6ba330c2798ba8223352a04b42ff0", "source_text": "A reduced, locally Noetherian algebraic stack <MATH_0001> such that\n<MATH_0002> is a singleton is regular.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a06d1de98074d74c9acf38c26c6f7413113640ad0389a4ebbbb3de4436e3f23d", "unit_id": "tag:06MV:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06ML", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$W \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0002": "$W$", "MATH_0003": "$k$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Spec(k) \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0005": "$T = W \\times_\\mathcal{Z} \\Spec(k)$", "MATH_0006": "$k$", "MATH_0007": "$T \\to W$", "MATH_0008": "$W$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{Z}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-unique-point-better}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-over-fields-lemma-smooth-regular}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{spaces-descent-lemma-descend-regular}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ac56949cddcfcc7405ffecf96b288637099e4fd8f9a6b07d94ac81c1494afbd2", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c593f563a42d7a816be0cb2b375750250fe7d2c995f91326a8edd36fb140e91c", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a surjective smooth morphism where <MATH_0002> is a scheme.\nLet <MATH_0003> be a field and let <MATH_0004> be surjective,\nflat, and locally of finite presentation (see\nLemma <REF_0001>).\nThe algebraic space <MATH_0005> is\nsmooth over <MATH_0006> in particular regular, see\nSpaces over Fields, Lemma <REF_0002>.\nSince <MATH_0007> is locally of finite presentation, flat, and surjective it\nfollows that <MATH_0008> is regular, see\nDescent on Spaces, Lemma <REF_0003>.\nBy definition this means that <MATH_0009> is regular.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:fee6d246e4e9027afde2e1f23a57060c8a030143c501acc492df399fee5091a7", "unit_id": "tag:06MV:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06ML", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$x \\in |\\mathcal{X}|$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Z}_x$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$f : \\Spec(K) \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0006": "$K$", "MATH_0007": "$x$", "MATH_0008": "$f$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{Z}_x \\to \\mathcal{X}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-residual-gerbe-points}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a89a88c43181377c7e4fa0c677db99b161b1b48a88352141a7e35f85a45775e6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4effb5ee28378bf46fd384773928b59318c919e18b23ce032183b9d037fe483a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an algebraic stack. Let <MATH_0002>.\nAssume that the residual gerbe <MATH_0003> of <MATH_0004> exists.\nLet <MATH_0005> be a morphism where <MATH_0006> is a field\nin the equivalence class of <MATH_0007>. Then <MATH_0008> factors through the inclusion\nmorphism <MATH_0009>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:cfdc4cf9f15ce2440188edf3cbeeb1ed22a69484927e0043c7aae36a022aa64a", "unit_id": "tag:06MW:statement"}
